# Inti, Seneschal of the Sun: "Whenever you attack, you may discard a card. When you do, ..." The discard is made as the
# ability resolves, so a player with no card in hand is not asked and nothing follows (! Bot1.Choose): no counter on Inti
# and, since nothing was discarded, no exiled card. Bot1 casts four Ornithopters and Inti on turn 1 and plays the Mountain it draws
# on turn 3, so its hand is empty when Inti attacks.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Inti, Seneschal of the Sun
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mountain
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Inti, Seneschal of the Sun.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Attack(Inti, Seneschal of the Sun > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Inti, Seneschal of the Sun.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
